### A. Technical / Preventive — Packet Filtering & Network Isolation (`iptables`)
Verified active `DOCKER-ISOLATION-STAGE-1` and `STAGE-2` chains enforcing `DROP` rules across container bridge networks alongside stateful connection tracking (`ctstate RELATED,ESTABLISHED`):

