B. Technical / Deterrent & Directive — SSH Pre-Login Banner (sshd_config)

Confirmed the SSH login warning banner directive is commented out by default (#Banner none). Enabling /etc/issue.net enforces a legal warning before authentication:
Plaintext

$ grep -i "banner" /etc/ssh/sshd_config
# no default banner path
#Banner none

C. Technical / Detective — Privilege Escalation Audit Trail (journalctl)

Modern Kali/Debian systems log authentication and sudo events via systemd-journald rather than legacy /var/log/auth.log. Verified complete audit accountability (TTY, PWD, USER, COMMAND):
Plaintext

